'''Blue Lagoon''' (Japanese: '''ブルーレイク''' ''Blue Lake'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive town in [[Johto]], located near a large lake on a mountain on [[Blue Point Isle]]. It is known for the large groups of {{p|Chinchou}} that live in the lake.

It is theorized that the Chinchou's undersea nesting ground was originally located here. Geological events led the land to rise from the sea where Blue Lagoon was built, complete with a large lake that Chinchou return to in order to nest. Due to the migration cycle the Chinchou make between the lagoon and the open ocean, Blue Lagoon hosts a festival around the event, called the [[Parade of the Chinchou]].

{{Ash}} and {{ashfr}} took a cable car in the hopes of reaching [[Bluefinland]], but they instead found themselves in Blue Lagoon. With little choice, they looked around the town and its lake and suddenly saw a Chinchou. {{an|Misty}} tried to catch it, only to find it already had a {{pkmn|Trainer}}, named [[Dayton]]. Dayton and his father [[Daizō]] provided more information to the group about the Parade of the Chinchou, which they later participated in.

